OL,3,GNEWSA4K Thunderbirds cinema restoration
OL,4,A'incredible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo classic episodes of the iconic
OL,7,F1960s TV show Thunderbirds have been
OL,8,Frestored in 4K, with special showings
OL,9,Ftaking place in cinemas on Saturday.
OL,11,FAtlantic Inferno and Attack of the
OL,12,FAlligators! both first aired in 1966,
OL,13,Fbut have now been brought back to life
OL,14,Ffor 21st century cinema-goers.
OL,16,FThunderbirds was made by long-time
OL,17,FHenley-on-Thames resident Gerry
OL,18,FAnderson, alongside his then-wife
OL,19,FSylvia, using puppetry and modelling,
OL,20,Fwith the series filmed in studios on
OL,21,FSlough Trading Estate.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
