OL,3,GNEWSA4K Thunderbirds cinema restoration
OL,4,A'incredible'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalking about the restoration of the
OL,7,Ftwo memorable episodes, Gerry's son
OL,8,FJamie Anderson said seeing them on the
OL,9,Fbig screen "just changes the experience
OL,10,Fof Thunderbirds forever".
